--[[
    Level 12 - Frostpeak
    A frozen mountain at night. New: moving platforms. They are one-way
    (land on top, jump up through them) and carry the ball. The Big ball
    makes them sag and slow down.

    1. base camp: the first platform carries you over a deep drop
    2. cliff lifts: three lifts up a tall shaft (falling only drops you
       back to the bottom)
    3. icicle cave: ride under icicles - shrink to Small to pass unhurt
    4. owl pass: four platforms with different timings; the key is above
       the third one
    5. wake lifts: they wait for you to land on them
    6. summit: a timer plate sends the lift up (it comes back down when the
       timer runs out), smash the cracked ice as Big, key door, flag

    Legend:  . empty   # snow / ice   = ice bricks   C cracked ice
             ^ spikes   v icicles   P pump   * gem   E penguin   B owl
             S start   G goal   H checkpoint   J spring   K key
             D locked door   a timer plate (group 1)
    platforms = { col, row, len, toCol, toRow, speed, wake, group }
]]

